# Install on the phone when work is done

When a turn changes the Taskr app, finish by building and installing on the connected iPhone. Do this before the reply. Do not stop at a simulator compile.

- Device: Jacob’s iPhone, id `00008160-00112DA82680000A`. If that phone is missing, list devices and use the connected physical iPhone.
- Project: `ios/Taskr.xcodeproj`, scheme `Taskr`. Sign with the project’s automatic team. Do not pass `CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO`.
- Build for `platform=iOS` with that device id and `-allowProvisioningUpdates`.
- Install the built `.app` with `xcrun devicectl device install app`, then launch `app.taskr.ios`.
- If the phone is locked, unplugged, or signing fails, say so. Do not claim it is on the phone.
- Do not push to GitHub unless asked.
